Appendix A. The Category CR is Well‑Defined

We verify that CR as defined in Section 2.1 satisfies the axioms of a category.

Objects and morphisms are as in Definitions 2.1 and 2.2. Composition is given by
g\circ f = (A, C, \mathrm{just}(g)\wedge\mathrm{just}(f),\; \min(\mathrm{conf}(f),\mathrm{conf}(g))\cdot \mathrm{coh}(f,g))
for f:C_1\to C_2 and g:C_2\to C_3.

